# Clean URL redirects — Cloudflare Pages
# Canonical is the clean URL (`/explore`). The previous rule
# `/explore → /explore.html 301` fought CF Pages' default `.html` stripping
# (`/explore.html → 308 → /explore`) and produced an infinite redirect loop
# that broke the Explore tab inside the FRQNCY mobile app's iframe shell.
# Pick one canonical (clean) and redirect aliases TO it.
/explore.html     /explore            301
/map              /explore            301
/network          /explore            301

